C-PDP-1 FOCAL, 1969/2026

01.10 C A DAMPED SINE WAVE ON THE TYPE 340, 1000 POINTS BY 600
01.20 SET Z=FDEV(1); SET Z=FCLR(0)
01.30 SET Z=FMOV(12,512); SET Z=FDRW(1012,512)
01.40 SET Z=FMOV(12,212); SET Z=FDRW(12,812); SET Z=FMOV(12,512)
01.50 FOR X=0,10,1000; DO 2
01.60 SET Z=FDEV(0); QUIT

02.10 SET Z=FDRW(12+X,512+300*FEXP(-X/400)*FSIN(X/50))
